Html: every form its examples take (area 19, "Changing a standard type's encoding")
encoding 1
column text

example <p>Fresh <strong>soup</strong> daily.</p>
text <p>Fresh <strong>soup</strong> daily.</p>
json "<p>Fresh <strong>soup</strong> daily.</p>"
stored '<p>Fresh <strong>soup</strong> daily.</p>'

example Tom &amp; Jerry
text Tom &amp; Jerry
json "Tom &amp; Jerry"
stored 'Tom &amp; Jerry'

example <ul><li>Leek</li><li>Tomato</li></ul>
text <ul><li>Leek</li><li>Tomato</li></ul>
json "<ul><li>Leek</li><li>Tomato</li></ul>"
stored '<ul><li>Leek</li><li>Tomato</li></ul>'

example <a href="https://example.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">our site</a>
text <a href="https://example.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">our site</a>
json "<a href=\"https://example.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">our site</a>"
stored '<a href="https://example.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">our site</a>'
